strike               =actor\fall_1,actor\fall_2,actor\fall_3
; [DA_PORT] physic_strike had no entry at all, so a hit from a physics object was silent.
; The engine walks every type in ALife::eHitTypeMax and warned on every start:
; "[actor_hit_snds] is missing sounds for type [physic_strike]". Reusing strike sounds -
; both are blunt physical contact, and it keeps the mod's own audio palette.
